{"paper": "CHSL-Tier1-11-Jul-2024-Shift1.pdf", "status": "ok", "mode": "sequential", "splitter": "qdot", "section_slice": true, "extracted_count": 25, "tagged_count": 25, "questions": [{"n": 1, "text": "The sum of two numbers is 76. Three times the larger number is 46 more than four times the smaller one. Find the two numbers.", "options": [{"text": "35 and 41", "added": false}, {"text": "40 and 36", "added": false}, {"text": "44 and 32", "added": false}, {"text": "50 and 26", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 2, "text": "If the number 6p5157q is divisible by 88, then p × q = ______, where p and q are single digit numbers.", "options": [{"text": "15", "added": false}, {"text": "18", "added": false}, {"text": "20", "added": false}, {"text": "12", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Number System", "sub": "divisibility-rules", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 3, "text": "A number increased by 20% gives 240. Find the number.", "options": [{"text": "240", "added": false}, {"text": "280", "added": false}, {"text": "200", "added": false}, {"text": "250", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "increase-decrease", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 4, "text": "PBA and PDC are two secants. AD is the diameter of the circle with the centre at O. ∠ A = 30°, ∠ P = 20°. Find the measure of ∠ DBC.", "options": [{"text": "50°", "added": false}, {"text": "30°", "added": false}, {"text": "45°", "added": false}, {"text": "40°", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 5, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 6, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 7, "text": "The ratio of red to green sweets in a bag is 3 : 4. How many red sweets are there in the bag if the number of green sweets is 120?", "options": [{"text": "100", "added": false}, {"text": "80", "added": false}, {"text": "70", "added": false}, {"text": "90", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Ratio-Proportion", "sub": "ratio-basics", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 8, "text": "A solid metallic sphere of radius 6 cm is melted and recast into spherical balls of radius 3 cm. The number of spherical balls thus obtained is:", "options": [{"text": "6", "added": false}, {"text": "10", "added": false}, {"text": "4", "added": false}, {"text": "8", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "conversion-and-melting", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 9, "text": "The following line graph shows the units manufactured by a company in some months. In which month did the company report the highest growth (in %) in production as compared with the respective previous month’s production?", "options": [{"text": "July", "added": false}, {"text": "October", "added": false}, {"text": "June", "added": false}, {"text": "September", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Data Interpretation", "sub": "line-graph", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 10, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 11, "text": "PQR is a triangle. MN is a line segment intersecting PQ in M and PR in N such that MN ∥ QR and divides ΔPQR into two parts, which are equal in area. What is the ratio of MQ to PQ?", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 2D", "sub": "triangle-and-quadrilaterals", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 12, "text": "Find the altitude (in cm) from the vertex Q to side PR of triangle PQR with side lengths PQ = 40 cm, PR = 40 cm and QR = 60 cm.", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 13, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 14, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 15, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 16, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 17, "text": "A laptop charger is sold for Rs.2,540 in cash or for a down payment of Rs.1,340 in cash together with Rs.1,205 to be paid after one month. Find the rate of interest charged in the instalment scheme.", "options": [{"text": "20% p.a.", "added": false}, {"text": "10% p.a.", "added": false}, {"text": "5% p.a.", "added": false}, {"text": "15% p.a.", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simple Interest", "sub": "si-instalments", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 18, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 19, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "80 and 81", "added": false}, {"text": "81 and 80", "added": false}, {"text": "78 and 80", "added": false}, {"text": "80 and 78", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 20, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "2017", "added": false}, {"text": "2019", "added": false}, {"text": "2016", "added": false}, {"text": "2018", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other